# Webflow CMS locales (Apropos)

- **Create** articles with `POST /collections/{id}/items/bulk` and `cmsLocaleIds: [DK, EN]`. Never rely on single-item `POST .../items` for localized content.
- **EN missing** on an existing item → skip translation; tell user to Add English in Designer. API cannot attach a secondary locale later.
- **Translate** via `lib/webflow/article-translation.ts`; publish EN only when DK is live.
- Full skill: `.cursor/skills/webflow-cms-localization/SKILL.md`
